\fs20\cgrid {\f1\cgrid0 Ben Gibbard and Friends  (Ben`s wife, Zooey Deschanel and David Crosby)
\par The Actors Gang (Ivy Substation)
\par Nov. 21, 2009
\par Culver City, California 
\par 
\par Format: FLAC
\par Source: Edirol R-09 > Magix audio cleaning lab 2004 > WAV
\par 
\par Setlist:
\par 01. Passenger Seat (piano)
\par 02. Soul Meets Body (piano)
\par 03. All Apologies (Nirvana cover/piano)
\par 04. Title & Registration (guitar)
\par 05. Cath (guitar)
\par 06. These Roads Don`t Move (guitar)
\par 07. You`re Running Wild (Emmylou Harris cover/guitar, with Zooey)
\par 08. Cuddly Toy (Harry Nilsson cover/with Zooey and Ben on piano)
\par 09. Why You`d Want To Live Here (guitar)
\par 10. This Place Is A Prison (guitar)
\par 11. Little Bribes (guitar)
\par 12. Grapevine Fires (guitar)
\par 13. One Fast Move Or I`m Gone (guitar)
\par 14. You Remind Me Of Home (guitar)
\par 15. Everybody`s Been Burned (Byrds cover/guitar, with David)
\par 16. Cathy`s Clown (Everly Bros. cover/guitar, with Zooey and David)
\par 17. All I Have To Do Is Dream (Everly Bros. cover/guitar, with Zooey and David)
\par 18. Such Great Heights (guitar)
\par Encore songs
\par 19. I Will Follow You Into The Dark (guitar)
\par 20. A Lack Of Color (guitar)
\par 21. Brand New Colony (guitar)
\par 
\par Only 100 tickets were sold for this concert, so this may possibly be the only recording of it.
\par Ben Gibbard played the instruments except on Cuddly Toy, Zooey also played the piano alongside Ben. Zooey Deschanel and David Crosby and Ben Gibbard were on vocals.
\par Source of music played: Death Cab For Cutie, Postal Service, songs from Ben`s Kerouac project with Jay Farrar, and the cover songs.
\par }}